[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:09.06]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:14.68]left a single note and went on their way
[00:19.36]I never got their name until the credits
[00:24.89]now it plays here every single day
[00:28.56]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:33.06]One note at a time
[00:38.56]from people passing through
[00:43.56]a name beside a line
[00:48.28]and part of it is you
[00:53.86]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
